        <tr id="comment-body-231014"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p><a href="https://dwd-wi.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3A0899fb7e-27de-4aba-bd24-969b2540a1c5" class="user-hover" rel="712020:0899fb7e-27de-4aba-bd24-969b2540a1c5" data-account-id="712020:0899fb7e-27de-4aba-bd24-969b2540a1c5" accountid="712020:0899fb7e-27de-4aba-bd24-969b2540a1c5" rel="noreferrer">Shaun Meinert</a> please see my summary for the developers above your original bug content - especially the mockup of the initial page with the eligibility message. Does this meet your expectations? If you have additional input, we can bring this to office hours for further discussion. Thanks! CC: <a href="https://dwd-wi.atlassian.net/jira/people/team/998ededc-ed96-4dec-9387-beb444ae1310?ref=jira$&amp;src=issue" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">ERP Tag Group</a> (<a href="https://dwd-wi.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3A7f1bd484-db0f-4d26-bad0-c849fc59f797" class="user-hover" rel="712020:7f1bd484-db0f-4d26-bad0-c849fc59f797" data-account-id="712020:7f1bd484-db0f-4d26-bad0-c849fc59f797" accountid="712020:7f1bd484-db0f-4d26-bad0-c849fc59f797" rel="noreferrer">Grace Konyar</a> <a href="https://dwd-wi.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3A0899fb7e-27de-4aba-bd24-969b2540a1c5" class="user-hover" rel="712020:0899fb7e-27de-4aba-bd24-969b2540a1c5" data-account-id="712020:0899fb7e-27de-4aba-bd24-969b2540a1c5" accountid="712020:0899fb7e-27de-4aba-bd24-969b2540a1c5" rel="noreferrer">Shaun Meinert</a> <a href="https://dwd-wi.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3A87ced96f-2dfb-46cf-8c85-5f9b0305a8ea" class="user-hover" rel="712020:87ced96f-2dfb-46cf-8c85-5f9b0305a8ea" data-account-id="712020:87ced96f-2dfb-46cf-8c85-5f9b0305a8ea" accountid="712020:87ced96f-2dfb-46cf-8c85-5f9b0305a8ea" rel="noreferrer">Heather Westley</a> <a href="https://dwd-wi.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3A10ac90e7-1a7d-4d2c-8a75-b712026dff48" class="user-hover" rel="712020:10ac9