        <tr id="comment-body-231228"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <p><a href="https://dwd-wi.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3Aba50c93a-1082-4ba6-bd5b-57cf0a24abb3" class="user-hover" rel="712020:ba50c93a-1082-4ba6-bd5b-57cf0a24abb3" data-account-id="712020:ba50c93a-1082-4ba6-bd5b-57cf0a24abb3" accountid="712020:ba50c93a-1082-4ba6-bd5b-57cf0a24abb3" rel="noreferrer">Michael Johnson</a> This ticket looks good. We would like to update the text on the new mockup to the following:</p>

<p>Employers with annual payroll under $500,000 may elect to exclude the wages of all principal corporate officers provided that they have an ownership interest in the corporation. More information about this exclusion is available "Help and Resources".</p>

<p>To be effective for a calendar year, the Corporate Officer Exclusion Election must be filed by March 31 of that year. </p>

<p>CC: <a href="https://dwd-wi.atlassian.net/jira/people/team/998ededc-ed96-4dec-9387-beb444ae1310?ref=jira$&amp;src=issue" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">ERP Tag Group</a> (<a href="https://dwd-wi.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3A7f1bd484-db0f-4d26-bad0-c849fc59f797" class="user-hover" rel="712020:7f1bd484-db0f-4d26-bad0-c849fc59f797" data-account-id="712020:7f1bd484-db0f-4d26-bad0-c849fc59f797" accountid="712020:7f1bd484-db0f-4d26-bad0-c849fc59f797" rel="noreferrer">Grace Konyar</a> <a href="https://dwd-wi.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3A0899fb7e-27de-4aba-bd24-969b2540a1c5" class="user-hover" rel="712020:0899fb7e-27de-4aba-bd24-969b2540a1c5" data-account-id="712020:0899fb7e-27de-4aba-bd24-969b2540a1c5" accountid="712020:0899fb7e-27de-4aba-bd24-969b2540a1c5" rel="noreferrer">Shaun Meinert</a> <a href="https://dwd-wi.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3A87ced96f-2dfb-46cf-8c85-5f9b0305a8ea" class="user-hover" rel="712020:87ced96f-2dfb-46cf-8c85-5f9b0305a8ea" data-account-id="712020:87ced96f-2dfb-46cf-8c85-5f9b0305a8ea" accountid="712020:87ced96f-2dfb-46cf-8c85-5f9b0305a8ea" rel="noreferrer">Heather Westley</a> <a href="https://dwd-wi.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3A10ac90e7-1a7d-4d2c-8a75-b712026dff48" class="user-hover" rel="712020:10ac90e7-1a7d-4d2c-8a75-b712026dff48" data-account-id="712020:10ac90e7-1a7d-4d2c-8a75-b712026dff48" accountid="712020:10ac90e7-1a7d-4d2c-8a75-b712026dff48" rel="noreferrer">Gayle Cottrill</a> <a href="https://dwd-wi.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3A2b95043f-e1ce-40db-987f-f9912471e07e" class="user-hover" rel="712020:2b95043f-e1ce-40db-987f-f9912471e07e" data-account-id="712020:2b95043f-e1ce-40db-987f-f9912471e07e" accountid="712020:2b95043f-e1ce-40db-987f-f9912471e07e" rel="noreferrer">Vada Bodimer</a> <a href="https://dwd-wi.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=712020%3Af311f009-771e-44b7-be3